{
    "_id": "04cbd7c7e3159f9e",
    "name": "Gunbreaker's Combo",
    "type": "feat",
    "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-steel-yellow.webp",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are trained in the gunblade's flowing strike sequences, the heart of the Traveler's art. You learn these combo actions as you grow in skill, and gain still more through @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.8167449ad5822303]{Advanced Cartridge Arts}:</p><p><strong>Single-target route:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.0f2a8e0288fb91c8]{Keen Edge} (1st) → @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.78f54cb87f5eafaa]{Brutal Shell} (2nd) → @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.b886b4f9b5e0ef3a]{Solid Barrel} (4th; the finisher loads a cartridge).</p><p><strong>Area route:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.be479ddf19c2509a]{Demon Slice} (1st) → @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.de5ec634e0595e50]{Demon Slaughter} (2nd; the finisher loads a cartridge).</p><p><strong>Spender:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.148481d3f7d0f02b]{Burst Strike} (2nd), which spends a cartridge for a powerful point-blank round.</p><p>Each combo step grants a brief effect enabling the next, and the bonus damage of your combo actions increases as you gain levels. These actions are added to your character automatically at the levels shown.</p>",
            "gm": ""
        },
